      "text": "Lecture 3"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00001",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 1,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Courtesy of MIT Press. Used with permission."
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00002",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 1,
      "section": null,
      "text": "6.006- Introduction to Algorithms"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00003",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "– Merge Sort"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00004",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Menu"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00005",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Sorting! – Insertion Sort"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00006",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Solving Recurrences"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00007",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "The problem of sorting"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00008",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Input: array A[1…n] of numbers."
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00009",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Output: permutation B[1…n] of A such"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00010",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "that B[1] ≤ B[2] ≤ … ≤ B[n] ."
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00011",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "How can we do it efficiently ?"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00012",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "– Maintain a telephone directory"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00013",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "– Find a median, or find closest pairs"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00014",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "– Binary search, identify statistical outliers"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00015",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "– Data compression: sorting finds duplicates"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00016",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "– Computer graphics: rendering scenes front to back"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00017",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Why Sorting?"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00018",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Obvious applications – Organize an MP3 library"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00019",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Problems that become easy once items are in sorted order"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00020",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Non-obvious applications"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00021",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "new location of key"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00022",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "key sorted"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00023",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "by pairwise key-swaps down to its right position"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00024",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "insert key A[j] into the (already sorted) sub-array A[1 .. j-1]."
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00025",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Insertion sort"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00026",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "for j ← 2 to n"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00027",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "INSERTION-SORT (A, n) [ A[1 . . n]"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00028",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Illustration of iteration j"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00029",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 6,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Example of insertion sort"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00030",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 16,
      "section": null,
      "text": "2 3 4 6 8 9 done"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00031",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 16,
      "section": null,
      "text": "e.g. when input is A = [n, n − 1, n − 2, . . . , 2, 1]"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00032",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 16,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Running time? Θ(n2) because Θ(n2) compares and Θ(n2) swaps"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00033",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 17,
      "section": null,
      "text": "(n2) swaps"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00034",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 17,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Use binary search to find the right position"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00035",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 17,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Binary Insertion sort"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00036",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 17,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Binary search with take Θ(log n) time."
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00037",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 17,
      "section": null,
      "text": "However, shifting the elements after insertion will"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00038",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 17,
      "section": null,
      "text": "still take Θ(n) time."
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00039",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 17,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Complexity: Θ(n log n) comparisons"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00040",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 17,
      "section": null,
      "text": "BINARY-INSERTION-SORT (A, n) [ A[1 . . n]"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00041",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 18,
      "section": null,
      "text": "3. “Merge” the two sorted sub-arrays."
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00042",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 18,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Key subroutine: MERGE"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00043",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 18,
      "section": null,
      "text": "MERGE-SORT A[1 . . n]"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00044",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 18,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Meet Merge Sort"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00045",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 18,
      "section": null,
      "text": "1. If n = 1, done (nothing to sort). divide and 2. Otherwise, recursively sort A[ 1 . . n/2 ] conquer and A[ n/2+1 . . n ] ."
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00046",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 19,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Merging two sorted arrays"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00047",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 31,
      "section": null,
      "text": "of n elements (linear time)."
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00048",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 31,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Time = Θ(n) to merge a total"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00049",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 32,
      "section": null,
      "text": "3. “Merge” the two sorted lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00050",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 32,
      "section": null,
      "text": "1. If n = 1, done. 2. Recursively sort A[ 1 . . ⎡n/2⎤ ] and A[ ⎡n/2⎤+1 . . n ] ."
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00051",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 32,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Analyzing merge sort"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00052",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 33,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Recurrence solving"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00053",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 33,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Solve T(n) = 2T(n/2) + cn, where c > 0 is constant."
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00054",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 34,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Recursion tree"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00055",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 36,
      "section": null,
      "text": "olve T(n) = 2T(n/2) + cn, where c > 0 is constant. S"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00056",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 42,
      "section": null,
      "text": "#leaves = n Θ(n)"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00057",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 43,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Total ?"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00058",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 44,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Total = Θ(n lg n)"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00059",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 44,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Equal amount of work done at each level"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00060",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 45,
      "section": null,
      "text": "#leaves = n Θ(n) n/2 c"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00061",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 45,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Tree for different recurrence"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00062",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 45,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Note that 1 + ½ + ¼ + … < 2 = Θ Total (n)"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00063",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 45,
      "section": null,
      "text": "All the work done at the leaves"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00064",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 45,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Solve T(n) = 2T(n/2) + c, where c > 0 is constant."
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00065",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 46,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Θ(1) #leaves = n"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00066",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 46,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Tree for yet another recurrence"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00067",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 46,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Solve T(n) = 2T(n/2) + cn2, c > 0 is constant."
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00068",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 46,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Note that 1 + ½ + ¼ + … < 2 Total = Θ(n2)"
    },
    {
      "id": "addb9ea7b4e1-00069",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 46,
      "section": null,
      "text": "All the work done at the root"
    }
  ]
}